  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'TASK FORCE BRIEFING // OPERATION IRON HARVEST

    Location: Echo-7 Logistics Yard | Mission: Eliminate Kronos PMC garrison & Col. Volkov''s Ironclad IFVs (Wave 9 Clear = Full Victory).

    

    [COMMAND & CALLSIGNS]

    - SGT. K. VANCE (VANGUARD-1): Forward Task Force operator dropped behind enemy AA lines to break Kronos fuel & armor staging.

    - LT. S. MERCER (OVERWATCH): High-altitude TAC-NET controller coordinating target telemetry and evac windows.

    - COL. VIKTOR VOLKOV (KRONOS-ACTUAL): Rogue mechanized commander inside IFV Ironclad Alpha, fortifying Echo-7.

    - CPT. H. TAKAHASHI (EVAC-6): UH-60 Dustoff pilot holding outside SAM range until Wave 9 IFV threat is neutralized.

    

    [KRONOS PMC THREAT INTEL]

    - MILITIA RIFLEMAN (AK-74): Fast breach troopers engaging at mid-range with single-shot tracer bursts. Concrete barriers block incoming rounds.

    - HEAVY GUNNER (PKM): Reinforced shock infantry firing 3-round 7.62mm suppressive bursts; flank between reload cycles.

    - IRONCLAD IFV (AUTOCANNON + MORTAR): Deployed Waves 3, 6, and 9 with coaxial turret fire, radial shrapnel volleys, and red artillery danger zones.

    

    [CAMPAIGN FIELD LOGS]

    - CHAPTER I [UNLOCKED]: Satellite sweeps detected armored fuel convoys staging under radar cover inside Echo-7.

    - CHAPTER II [LOCKED - Reach Wave 4]: Clear Wave 3 IFV Scout-01 to decrypt Kronos inner depot traffic.

    - CHAPTER III [LOCKED - Reach Wave 7]: Advance past Act II Fuel Depot to unlock extraction orders.

'
